      "text": "This itinerary brings together very different sides of Brazil. First, you will see Rio de Janeiro from Sugar Loaf and Corcovado, then travel to Iguazu Falls. After the cities and major sights, the journey turns to nature: the Pantanal, Bonito, tropical forests, rivers, caves and waterfalls. The final days are spent on the beaches of Búzios.",
